<title>UK: Rheinische Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinische Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Chase Manhatten.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    01.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    PAR	 LISTING    FRANKFURT DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		STEPS-UP TO 7.25 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
